{"root":{"data":{"id":"dkoctuyhtsw0","created":1786678950979,"text":"Relaycepyt","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkocw7gpczk0","created":1786679134930,"text":"多租户身份以及workspace隔离","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-31.833331909444667,"y":-593.3333180016948},"expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkodzaqaqq80","created":1786682198243,"text":"系统管理用户的层级：Organization和Workspace","layout_right_offset":{"x":46.249998317410586,"y":-80.83333185977403}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodzow7u1c0","created":1786682229076,"text":"每一个workspace如何验证，连接，和配置的（JWT,membership authorization）","layout_right_offset":{"x":38.3333326793379,"y":-32.08333326917551}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe01za4rc0","created":1786682257559,"text":"与数据库的业务查询带的显示id，以及数据库RLS纵深防御","layout_right_offset":{"x":44.16666491164119,"y":24.166665706369656}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe293e63c0","created":1786682429774,"text":"核心考察：JWT与BFF；多租户建模；应用层授权；数据库RLS；跨租户关系testing；Repository tenant scope；","layout_right_offset":{"x":42.33334492312497,"y":79.16666352086617},"font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkocucomsps0","created":1786678989565,"text":"将HubSpotWebhook安全，幂等的接入","expandState":"expand","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-79.50000188748021,"y":-199.99999682108557},"layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoe3ejosqg0","created":1786682520007,"text":"这一部分的核心业务作用：HubSpot workflow将已经完成 qualification、scoring 和 routing 的 Response Event 发送给系统。","layout_right_offset":{"x":24.999999006589405,"y":-93.33332962459997},"font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoeeaxb9uo0","created":1786683374129,"text":"如何证明请求来自Hubspot"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodo52ezog0","created":1786681323909,"text":"产品边界与定位","layout_mind_offset":{"x":63.58334283075391,"y":-1311.166636649106}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkodpicvuvc0","created":1786681431204,"text":"面向的客户","layout_right_offset":{"x":49.99999875823664,"y":-189.1666610745924}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodxdc6owg0","created":1786682047191,"text":"要解决的问题","layout_right_offset":{"x":39.5833322260944,"y":-181.66666118635112}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodxukznao0","created":1786682084729,"text":"我们的边界：哪些是我们做的，哪些不是我们做的","layout_right_offset":{"x":36.6666652096643,"y":-185.8333259489807}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe7izc01s0","created":1786682843117,"text":"我们遇到的技术难点是什么","layout_right_offset":{"x":67.4999973177911,"y":-22.49999910593033}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe9wxvqzs0","created":1786683030232,"text":"你们产品的核心模块是什么","layout_right_offset":{"x":49.166664712959005,"y":-199.99999205271433}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe25qnia00","created":1786682422473,"text":"核心考察：对产品的理解；产品的核心模块；系统边界的设计；模块化的能力；能否区分已经实现和未来规划。","layout_right_offset":{"x":0,"y":-36.666665209664416}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe7yjgkgo0","created":1786682876985,"text":"为什么选择模块化单体而不是微服务","layout_right_offset":{"x":46.66666481229993,"y":-244.99999026457522}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe87fsm200","created":1786682896355,"text":"当前实现和未来扩展的边界在哪里","layout_right_offset":{"x":57.49999771515547,"y":-401.6666507058683}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodr7106y80","created":1786681563270,"text":"一条Lead的处理线，直到\"WAITTING_APPROVAL\"","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-22.499987818300866,"y":-4.470348358154297e-7}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodrt5jwo00","created":1786681611434,"text":"从人工审批到再次进入OutBox","layout_mind_offset":{"x":584.7500000931323,"y":40.750001061707735}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkodtyeetvk0","created":1786681779582,"text":"异步执行：从OutBox到Provider Adapter","layout_right_offset":{"x":571,"y":-4}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkodu4h99600","created":1786681792815,"text":"从Adatper到真正产生外部副作用","layout_right_offset":{"x":592,"y":8}},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodukveo2g0","created":1786681828499,"text":"崩溃恢复：成功，重试，与未知结果","layout_mind_offset":{"x":607.7500006891787,"y":229}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodv1esn4g0","created":1786681864500,"text":"Recovery 与控制塔输出","layout_m